Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3-4 Energ\[IAcute]a transferida y dosis en tejidos vivos", "Section",
 CellFrame->{{3, 0}, {0, 0.5}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0, 0, 1],
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.935515845683177*^9, 3.935515849943137*^9}, {
   3.9356999575611343`*^9, 3.9356999632170334`*^9}, {3.939294636528504*^9, 
   3.939294642762233*^9}, {3.951589140619224*^9, 3.951589142010891*^9}, {
   3.951669940033366*^9, 3.9516699478229322`*^9}, {3.951670332399876*^9, 
   3.951670332931019*^9}, 3.960547930283841*^9, {3.969476521475095*^9, 
   3.969476526032505*^9}, {3.969476984571576*^9, 3.96947699172572*^9}, {
   3.969567948678548*^9, 3.969567980938149*^9}, {3.969568021123867*^9, 
   3.969568032068366*^9}, {3.969568067081376*^9, 3.969568069578418*^9}, {
   3.96956815008892*^9, 3.969568175160637*^9}, {3.9700700579858646`*^9, 
   3.9700700641965714`*^9}, {3.977656454330055*^9, 3.9776564594789543`*^9}, {
   3.984319868343418*^9, 3.984319869775444*^9}, {3.9843485416570473`*^9, 
   3.98434854694545*^9}},
 FontFamily->"Times New Roman",
 FontColor->GrayLevel[0],
 Background->RGBColor[
  1., 1., 0.],ExpressionUUID->"7416e5ce-3031-fd43-be26-262d557df4b5"],

Cell["\<\
La dosis es una medida de la cantidad de energ\[IAcute]a que las radiaciones \
ionizantes transfieren a un material, en este caso, al cuerpo humano. 

La dosis permite cuantificar el efecto f\[IAcute]sico de la radiaci\[OAcute]n \
sobre el cuerpo, por ello es posible:
\t1. Evaluar el riesgo biol\[OAcute]gico de una exposici\[OAcute]n.
\t2. Dise\[NTilde]ar tratamientos de radioterapia.
\t3. Estimar da\[NTilde]os a \[OAcute]rganos o tejidos.
\t4. Aplicar medidas de protecci\[OAcute]n radiol\[OAcute]gica.\t\
\>", "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9530649721703463`*^9, 3.953064988003974*^9}, {
   3.953065028655744*^9, 3.95306503663035*^9}, {3.953993265456999*^9, 
